@StudentManagementAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Get all students
GET {{StudentManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/students
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get student by ID
GET {{StudentManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/students/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Add a new student
POST {{StudentManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "David Miller",
    "email": "david.miller@example.com",
    "course": "Cloud Computing"
}

### 4. Update an existing student
PUT {{StudentManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Johnathan Doe",
    "email": "john.doe@example.com",
    "course": "Advanced Computer Science"
}

### 5. Delete a student
DELETE {{StudentManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/students/5
